To be robust, support:
- arrayBuffer
- text
- json (serialize back to JSON? but then envelope detection works; raw bytes case wouldn't use json)
- body Buffer/string

But if I call `.json()` I get an object, not bytes. I could handle: if arrayBuffer/text/body absent but json present, use the parsed object directly as envelope. Let me restructure to handle both byte responses and object responses.

